  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ace7e886ab21575bbd5787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘的荷叶边～♪\r\n在舞台上很抢眼对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf492c41db956682f2b58417261610e8e191c4a4d782da63e7d264f71bd6d50b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c31cf5d573c23d72a2a1326c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是赛马娘最棒的打扮。\r\n现在的机伶很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b492dc41006a47fc538da94a60583917afb7a5205c91c578ec8fdb2cc7430e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c29f8d276fcae20886839fe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有现在才能享受制服的青春感觉，\r\n我好想拼命穿它哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb0d134308546a257518a10aaf6e037b3a49ba407307ccb3c160d8605579ec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:467c20e0e325b230ec47314f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶穿着吊袜带……\r\n会让你小鹿乱撞吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d840efa8798ec603a5db6d4578baf9815d22139c486d108126df0c613d0f581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67cf1472614af620f15b04e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装塞满了机伶的终极武器。\r\n……我一定要登上巅峰才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "21342f4233c9664aa204c9770f4bb6e7fb976ddb5a466beb1a8c8c6869070a78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f0d0561a9772bb6da313ca3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪你能从这件决胜服，\r\n感受到我们的命运吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "624713205fa129444f874817066a13864a2e0f327a6764d2961a8ce93e4e3939",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c70c998a60c75cd9023fad67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件黑色衣服～\r\n是机伶「认真」的可爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "90b00ba46557f96fbd249a3671cd6eef7839d9d3598c7fb3bf3ade63024e14b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e82e8a7640118fc91d684f3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55ff3d4663880cfc859ca0b220d271a88c52fb350ed26371b2af31f71e6444e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff161125eb4554b205d24530",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶才是最可爱的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d024db203c80d0ce73ac48703d96bc4597e3f176a36cb1240db855d6c8a0186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea0b72889b2017e06bb2bbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想邀我去约会了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "79df8705999e46aa803017a5928b1749d3baea67a1e257232763ebc41a22fb9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdfce3d3e7c8a3c54c88fc13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可以将真机伶的可爱穿搭\r\n头到脚仔细看过一遍唷♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "adfeea57ddfadeccc0245a849d440eef987058a617edb3fcfa77b6705d43e1a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614f0f513c7913ab68ccb97b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到这套制服时，\r\n机伶就觉得注定要穿上它了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b841352f95bd0986f49d9a03eac9a7b436b74d35a1d15f7f72c04f27349621df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
