      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:390775e423a2b70f9bb00f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶才是最可爱的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d024db203c80d0ce73ac48703d96bc4597e3f176a36cb1240db855d6c8a0186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:194686a78cbb909232b234a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f4bce504ad3a782bc7db58c1c3bf690d86ff33e4ad95b0ec3aed85c79ec42e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2710b12b576e8d2eeb320e87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真机伶才是最可爱的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6813e894e2d666b65e30934a20390ef5214b66ea7ddeda4b6975dbd086f77679",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "800000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e72f03a9d985123b2f7d3914",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想跟机伶玩吗？\r\n我们来尽情享受一下吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0c5819c3e3a51bec9e690a3052a14f6138698db482f4dd79031e1963a0e0e20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c90a9dc343a2669f4f3eb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都好厉害哦♪\r\n那机伶就来变得\r\n更厉害好了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61113409d0420be265707e4bf24670d0a76b01a45957cbaafc4852b5a9a89113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24452fdd5f39e949e27b5073",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，早安！\r\n今天的机伶也是\r\n可爱得无懈可击吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f6ba3dc18d1ccb00fb6b90869d3cbcdbb218213ce1985b868e476beaf66a49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88caa4dcb37385bef80e984d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的例行计划？\r\n应该是一起床就向太阳公公打招呼吧！\r\n请它今天也要让我耀眼动人☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b1b67b480f9910ad961fa6823efd0abfa79147778c5d679a3bb3ab1f753f225",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e618e3cd39afe7c2022c479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『#今天的点心　#好烦恼\r\n#马卡龙　#蛋糕　#芭菲\r\n#消除可爱不足』……写好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b9e38118384a89151adc9f49b3307d568e26efcfc55cb15e183660dc10898d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08285156f1955cacf6474ae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……有点想睡……\r\n哥哥，你要当我的抱枕吗？\r\n没有啦☆……下次再说吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29ee1a16288efb38bda51ba1bdf656d122107eb5ebcdbc77c667b9ea5cc7526",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d66ad56e9b1ea4c2e609ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶闪闪动人的笑容，\r\n当作你努力一整天的奖励♪\r\n来，只给你一个人独占哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8426373049c6fbca94794a3acae8da314589b0cf3558b22a55938f6c82e37c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe51b675d0837982afa16352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别熬夜了，快睡吧？\r\n这样的话，或许在梦中\r\n也能见到机伶……哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "47c25aff4086c4e35f2a13f0d503e63880b88e9155228794ffd823f6a4cb685f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3986e1a95a5652a3272313d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我哥哥以前很喜欢与春天有关的\r\n曲子，所以机伶的拿手曲目\r\n也多半和春天相关！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12fab86c463160a48ab1429e42bf85abc12acecfaa823b9e6475ad515684e75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:603bf223266753bcd9ea12c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶不管是在家里或学校，都很少\r\n觉得热呢。是因为回过神来\r\n就有人帮忙扇风的关系……吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff049de81cf9b2793781ca3ca859e996ab1c0b86cf8d1e71cbaeadf971bbc36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c37e791aa345a6351f0ec79f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不是只有叶子会染上颜色哦。\r\n比方说，耳朵靠过来……呼～♪\r\n啊哈哈，你看，变得红通通的了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11c7aff2cb6444063de7f658c7a1e27cec314ef2b03f6a9edfa1b6a55b94560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f39f4914fd7c6a4a701ee4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎……机伶快要结冰了。\r\n呐，帮我取暖吧？该怎么做？当然是\r\n用热～呼呼的……关东煮约会之类咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce75c242c2f48086c07112c017438cebc8fe863dfb7ffcfc24e18eb928c0a7a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d36fd0a72a16a30055110b87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥早餐比较喜欢吃饭？吃面包？\r\n还是……喜欢机伶呢？开玩笑的♪\r\n机伶喜欢的是……秘密喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a73d22553b14008f9c8d772fca149249b89c7b5f12d18033d72e0d9bba1e5528",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5b008fbc6c6c87857f07e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥去上班时，\r\n想要别人怎么送你出门？\r\n机伶可以让你指定喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "61116a33f68f832ede20b484d71217b57f06525c369cb63987064b54c3549fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a8794f8a60d1e9082608689",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶下次想和\r\n哥哥一起吃午餐呢～\r\n让机伶喂你吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a389d6cb1276089af49330e9a4001403c4d1a5050d585120b937ce46651d0984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:911b7805edf2b474ff095939",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥待在穿这件衣服的\r\n机伶旁边时，是什么样的心情？\r\n……晚点偷偷告诉我吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3892b00e60c17b63a30384449cbf15b8b403d67877d9f530ae841624b5e21b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a45d2bd4be72c316130431ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多到天色要开始变暗的时间了。\r\n有没有人能送我回宿舍呢～\r\n（……偷瞄♪）",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c4590ef31489a746c3ec46788fdb505d23ea9ee26c5ba03b0b4a1e3d50e449c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61763c0f5039ae7282d71a4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪就这样一起参加时髦的派对，\r\n吸引大家的目光吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86463df590826e3c7ea94eaf02793c8e9530e834fa095ed0ddc62eec61c1a10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:046f949f1b93edbd62bc5930",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然春天是充满\r\n邂逅和别离的季节，\r\n但机伶绝～对不会和哥哥分开♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e38fac9604620cd41ed207658b3d21ba323a529516d06d63433c1dd3946395",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed2276c8096c6b63d89c25ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许会有许多幽灵被这套优雅\r\n又可爱的服装吸引过来喔。\r\n……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "814ffbd57a733e9de26474369567eef8e8a677f75b5aaa275bc8a0b5a9c46f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b19476f39ff7d62ab1d65c1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天其实也有很多人办婚礼！\r\n……话说你不觉得这件衣服的颜色，\r\n和秋天也很搭吗？呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06cc3c9e3594e93aadf2c8b89022d6c5596bf57414ef1a4905ae06f8b9c6ea3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac74dd9e5649f070fb4396be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白雪和黑衣互相衬托，\r\n一定会变得很可爱～\r\n……甚至到了让人忘记寒冷的程度♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca4400495c32111280a6525aca15805c5498840743a0b54f027de3702b2a375",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1012afeb8755820e5ba8d599",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62039800d74c56d72821f17d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11c951f865c24e5747744eb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，早安！\r\n今天的机伶也是\r\n可爱得无懈可击吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f4955b2564c29e597e17f19f3b2e9c19c822f1926bf71c9e630b472c7018842",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b3f420e8584487c1c1a7a35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……有点想睡……\r\n姐姐，你要当我的抱枕吗？\r\n没有啦☆……下次再说吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "270e5c0deebdc8cf6d4f7a5abd1d6b5c22412f13fecb1b5c02fd6d4215410d2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03584bd350e0234135a61b86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐早餐比较喜欢吃饭？吃面包？\r\n还是……喜欢机伶呢？开玩笑的♪\r\n机伶喜欢的是……秘密喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "158d2b70e613af5b723e53b40a76fa40130dba51399b85e39f95840c0c0eb4c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377c8710339fb60cea585733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐去上班时，\r\n想要别人怎么送你出门？\r\n机伶可以让你指定喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e734b8d88d93bc0db1a02740a9e25a45fda879da3bc31197b9b3a82fc112bd93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c0774f8535c057cf1aaf7a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶下次想和\r\n姐姐一起吃午餐呢～\r\n让机伶喂你吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e0f62576666020fc527bf1c0f1f4ea32c1935bdd8d0d86ab1376ccc3cd22a5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48c709f06a670c5e1e8bb902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐待在穿这件衣服的\r\n机伶旁边时，是什么样的心情？\r\n……晚点偷偷告诉我吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bccea510e027b348d11ad2fb8314e1ed1beb01e60772d31a87acf18db7384ea2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e8a16a1aceeef03664b189",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然春天是充满\r\n邂逅和别离的季节，\r\n但机伶绝～对不会和姐姐分开♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "489e1d4b2a347e62346a5df230065c21fb33343f6db53279bbb0dae55aa555c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df089d4837c7333e93abf9e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该向家人做定时报告了。\r\n我要告诉他们，机伶今天也\r\n活力十足，而且超可爱的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bee152e96879fa73b36afb6dc1ea3e926284cf8946187d9eac75576b6eada1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf2822146196be0f1683c6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要把Umasta的头像换掉呢？\r\n哥哥所拍的机伶很可爱嘛。\r\n这就是爱吗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "34802d5be1c81cbee9271a3eef3eacd3715f5ea89961937d824ff6aa0550cfec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1e320e766578ffdd772e84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近有和小Maya去买东西！\r\n她很有品味，最重要的是直觉敏锐，\r\n所以帮了不少忙～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1574d14270774bcdc5168407cadbb9a873c565d937c302a0f2d91139578e6747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:888b27c12966783216257404",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之所以会疯狂更新Umasta，\r\n是为了追求可爱的大家。\r\n所以这不是中毒，而是义务！",
      "source_fingerprint": "484b3549e81d1c26372f137a508729951d9eb5c3a11d690fa38d15b0a7ba54a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02f0b6099e01314b5526fd2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从讨厌的事物可以看穿一个人，\r\n所以机伶不会公诸于世。\r\n这样大家才会更想知道吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "14eb7b5d63e183cb5c40dcf379a94c0673d0d5ddc0940cd3a8ba7e6f10c7f643",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a38ff7fb848c889a83f8bd93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘又讲究的可爱服装♪\r\n在SNS上面也大受好评哦。\r\n他们说很适合我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "931f2f7680be70fae81214b929c897c29aba979c493c3a92157e63a674891021",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32ee6ccf879c732319227d52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶完全不介意\r\n和大家穿一样的服装哦。\r\n这样反倒会让我更抢眼嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e03e25ea315246fc43c2013c1b01398dd98463c6536e4612064de387e650c034",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:792e1655c56b67f29ea4b3da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑白分明，不过要可爱。\r\n机伶所面对的挑战，\r\n永远都要这样才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f844b02812f353450819f04ae475d170ebf9ede1ff68233a488dc99e72b8d3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad1a9703ae0bf2134391850",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都说机伶的决胜服\r\n意外地很奇特呢。\r\n……或许正如我所料♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "331753cd6fae63aec68c8cc2a7a7fa50c7e31251ea5431fb8743dec387346a85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45470342e0b2597d7f19a321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『#今天的梦　#过去是石器\r\n#未来是平行世界　#粉丝\r\n#增加的梦　#将会是　#预知梦哦』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7569a38c406972de8bc3f7744b8429e9c421670df5e14ffff88df96e3ddd633b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a28f32ab95e2228927970e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是能在外面吃午餐就好了。\r\n我偶尔也会想在安静的地方，\r\n让你看看……我发愣的侧脸♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "004263d39f93f5ec2ab4e362dedb4e0e4851fd377275f677baa1a1c41799c50d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc1cc363e4ad8fcb99747ece",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果机伶开始打瞌睡，\r\n你可以悄悄搂住我的肩膀没关系哦。\r\n我会装作没看到的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1826a6a651f0e63868a5f9c42918d139cdf3c94e0bdf592b9cab528966d9937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d312e40147d42dcee84c6a2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有关注者把机伶比喻为樱花啊。\r\n哥哥很清楚，我并没有\r\n那么虚无缥缈对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d387cc04084718306c7a6df0c3bfc86eb5b1134edfd571ef562d9f4b8aad949",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8285d9a2f39b5f050e74006a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年要穿什么样的泳装好呢？\r\n差不多该挑战比基尼了……\r\n嘿嘿，对机伶来说还太早了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b96a1da9a4e279cec826b4708c71da8fb22d42e5f1497a5a594f4d163a0e34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88c9f2c54d9f90c99181858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要吃个地瓜再回去吗？\r\n把它吹凉的模样很可爱，\r\n而且双手捧着会让脸看起来比较小！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e546ca70b80865ef9f8c6991c6fe55bc8206913ead4fb3907e7b6ce7be571b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75be548885b274e99f07edaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪是一块纯白的画布。\r\n如果是我……就会站着不动。\r\n大家之后会随心所欲地作画♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b2b73b0a7fd561a3baf423f0ef02ca7cd52d49b321c4e25e2025999695214c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335839d20803de34093db7c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是谁，都无法盖过\r\n机伶的可爱♪所以……\r\n哥哥要试试看把我染上你的颜色吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6af74aa21a363000a07aa936c534ef34576ff82ffc1b8ce0cad62bd79736a5c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7254f5affe38b857df7d928",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和生野比赛时，能感觉到她对使用的\r\n物品非常讲究，她的这一点\r\n很可爱，机伶也想向她学习♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "075093ecacd890414cb76ffe461d7b26cb6aa743091614d3c15093816cf2dfdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97dd12535858f33ba65bd722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶能体会米浴希望别人\r\n幸福的心情～机伶也想把\r\n许多可爱的一面传达给粉丝们♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4964331be7e0e3ec3f39d8ee23aaba4b6d58dce33537ef4e44aeba76aa252c8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c87c701bca40dc5630514781",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纯真……是一种纤细的特质。\r\n所以机伶非常尊敬乌拉拉♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3761b780e6f5c579729e5bee1020bc0023f30e5c63785f5fd0ee800c6f74b469",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2034bf227123d373f6f697ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶和美妙，\r\n或许有一点像呢。\r\n……例如对甜点的喜好♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd49422b15cbe12248a990641ee6b1a5c18e676acd4358fe461828cc2343a35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fc90679fc98a7da7bfff73d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然舍不得放弃早上去叫哥哥\r\n起床的机会～\r\n但让你叫我起床也不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8039b2ee208063d602ee875033dad2fadab3e704224f5eae3a4162cf2e170d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfbbe39012e97cf042a57e1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪好想再和美妙她们\r\n一起去咖啡厅，\r\n和大家一起分享甜点呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cf7ad74cd4206182ce829fce6ebeb85fc32687e5ac2a5a75d7c5792598e147a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e376e811c83ff8c20ac33f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服的颜色很容易融进夜晚里，\r\n但哥哥应该找得到机伶吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5e6ac4a60be71a7caf947a43aa2075452d80b172ff2ab269ac6634a150f6ddd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a4dbd63b232bd77f8477a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然赏花也不错～\r\n但希望哥哥一直觉得\r\n「机伶比花更漂亮」呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b981155523567601b31260580d5625f18cc4ffc98a6ae19cdf3f6677e322ac37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8873b0511f3321ce8cd90515",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服明明这么可爱，\r\n穿起来却依然很凉爽兼具功能性，\r\n真不愧是Beauty小姐的设计呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8944eabbfde80ca8ebbb10dd4dd71683e8cb8f7763eb9b8f19db0ea73a3044",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "91025"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
